stdout | Generate project info file
stdout |
stdout | Usage: elp project-info [OPTIONS]
stdout |
stdout | Options:
stdout |       --project <PROJECT>  Path to directory with project, or to a JSON file [default: .]
stdout |       --to <TO>            Path to a directory where to dump wa.build_info
stdout |       --buck-query         Include the buck uquery results in the output
stdout |       --target-types       Dump a list of targets and their types
stdout |   -h, --help               Print help
stdout |
stdout | Global options:
stdout |       --log-file <LOG_FILE>  
stdout |       --erl <ERL>            
stdout |       --escript <ESCRIPT>    
stdout |       --no-log-buffering     
stdout |       --no-buck-generated    Deprecated (no-op): buck project loading always builds generated code
stdout |       --buck-quick-start     Deprecated (no-op): buck project loading always builds generated code
stdout |       --color <WHEN>         Use color in output [default: always] [possible values: always, never,
stdout |                              auto]
